.TH VEYON-AUTH-HELPER 8 2026-11-26 VEYON
.SH NAME
veyon-auth-helper \- Veyon PAM Authentication Helper
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B veyon-auth-helper
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B veyon-auth-helper
checks user names and passwords with PAM for the Veyon service
(\fBveyon-service\fP) when Veyon uses logon authentication.
.PP
It is a D-Bus service on the system bus (\fIio.veyon.AuthHelper\fP), started on
demand through the systemd unit \fIveyon-auth-helper.service\fP. Only root (the
Veyon service) may call it. It is not meant to be run by hand and, since
Veyon 4.11, it is not installed setuid root.
.SH OPTIONS
No options present.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR veyon-service (1),
.BR veyon-server (1),
.BR veyon-cli (1)
.PP
.I https://veyon.io/
